- EXPERIMENTAL
- Parameters:
  - Edges SQL with columns: id, source, target, cost [,reverse_cost]
  - From ARRAY[vertices identifiers]
- Optional Parameters
  - Maximum Depth := 9223372036854775807
  - directed := true
- Documentation:
  - https://docs.pgrouting.org/latest/en/pgr_breadthFirstSearch.html
';

